    <dcterms:title xml:lang="en">ePO Core core</dcterms:title>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">This artefact provides the definitions for the eProcurement Ontology Core.
        This artefact excludes the restrictions.
        The eProcurement Ontology describes objects and concepts, with definitions, attributes and relationships which are present within the European public procurement domain.
        The provision of these concepts provides the basis for a common understanding of the domain for all stakeholders ensuring the quality of data exchange and transparency.</rdfs:label>
